    "Description": "Cockpit enables users to administer GNU/Linux servers using a web browser. It offers network configuration, log inspection, diagnostic reports, SELinux troubleshooting, interactive command-line sessions, and more.\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* cockpit: Cockpit: Unauthenticated remote code execution due to SSH command-line argument injection [rhel-9.8] (JIRA:RHEL-158310)\n\n* cockpit: lodash: Arbitrary code execution via untrusted input in template imports [rhel-9.8] (JIRA:RHEL-164196)",
